## Decisions and Action Items

* **Charter Update:** Include the privacy section in the revised charter draft before submitting for approval.
* **`draft-ietf-vcon-vcon-core` Updates:**
  * Update redacted string markers to record full marker strings with an upper length bound.
  * Change `redacted_segments` to use duration instead of end time.
  * Clarify media type unfolding rules (sender must unfold; receiver should tolerate).
  * Fix CDDL syntax errors in schema comments and correct JWS header definitions.

